# I Am the Walrus, refrain (figure 121.5)
# Three bars C D E arriving on V; Pollack labels the numerals with respect to V (flat VI of V,
# flat-VII of V). The fourth bar (D, IV) is played in the third refrain only, so it carries his
# "3rd refrain, only" as a bar mark.
key A

system
chords   | C{flat-VI of V} | D{flat-VII of V} | E{V} | [3rd refrain only] D{IV} |
